OL,3,GNEWSASchool's strict rules led to boy's
OL,4,Adeath - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FLonghorn is preparing a rare Prevention
OL,7,Fof Future Deaths report. These are made
OL,8,Fwhen a coroner identifies circumstances
OL,9,Fwhich create a risk of future deaths.
